{"id":68856,"date":"2025-06-17T16:59:37","date_gmt":"2025-06-17T15:59:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68856"},"modified":"2026-09-28T20:36:31","modified_gmt":"2026-09-28T19:36:31","slug":"maratona-de-murcia","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-murcia\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de M\u00farcia 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de M\u00farcia 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de M\u00farcia 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>7 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, com tiro de partida no emblem\u00e1tico Paseo del Malec\u00f3n e meta triunfal junto \u00e0 imponente S\u00e9 Catedral, em <strong>M\u00farcia<\/strong>, Espanha. Organizada pelo <strong>Club Murcia Runcity<\/strong>, esta prova de refer\u00eancia internacional atrai milhares de atletas pelo seu tra\u00e7ado plano, r\u00e1pido e clima ameno de inverno.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo disponibiliza tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias oficiais homologadas: a prova rainha da <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong>, a concorrida <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> e a r\u00e1pida prova de <strong>10 km<\/strong>. O percurso \u00e9 integralmente plano e desenhado no centro hist\u00f3rico e avenidas largas da cidade, oferecendo m\u00faltiplos pontos de anima\u00e7\u00e3o, postos de abastecimento a cada 5 km e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica assegura cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip com tempos interm\u00e9dios, seguran\u00e7a vi\u00e1ria integral, guarda-roupa, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e diploma digital para todos os finalistas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; ov